  "formal_scope": "The rank-doubling theorem with an arbitrary partner, strong minimum-rank multiplicativity, the Tiles support and normalized density operators, and the exact all-copy Schmidt-number equivalence are formalized in 22 Lean modules. The zero-error LOCC cost, the rank-four two-qutrit PPT class and the channel interpretation combine the formal theorem with published results.",
